# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Eagles' Peak" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
# Hand edits (marked "# Authored (not Wiki)" where lines were added): replies for the Wiki's quest=No / empty options
# (Charlie's animals, Nickolaus's ferret, Asyff's shop options), the shout menu's "above" -> "replay" (EaglesPeak.kt replays
# the first meeting's answer) and "initial" -> "above", the broken colour-template box fixed, {{mes}}/{{overhead}} lines moved
# to EaglesPeak.kt, and the "(authored)" sections at the end.
0	section	Starting out
0	section	Before starting Eagle's Peak
1	line	Player	Hi!
1	line	Charlie	Yes, er, welcome to the zoo! I'm afraid I'm kind of busy right now; what was it you wanted?
1	option	Ah, you sound like someone who needs a quest doing!
2	line	Player	Ah, you sound like someone who needs a quest doing!
2	cond	If the player is below level 27 in Hunter:
3	line	Charlie	Well... maybe. How much do you know about hunting?
3	line	Player	Well I know a little bit...
3	line	Charlie	No, I could do with some help, but I'm afraid I need somebody with a little more experience.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player is level 27 or above in Hunter:
3	line	Charlie	Actually, now that you come to mention it, you might be able to help me.
3	line	Charlie	A few weeks ago we had a delivery of a northern ferret. They're funny little creatures. Turns out they're tricksy little blighters too.
3	line	Charlie	Whilst we were unloading him from the cart he managed to escape his cage. What's more he gave the driver a nasty nip on the way out too.
3	line	Charlie	This was obviously a bit of a blow, you can't make a new attraction without any animals.
3	line	Charlie	We got in contact with one of our associates, a huntsman called Nickolaus, who agreed to capture us another.
3	line	Charlie	Funny thing is we haven't heard from him for some time now. I don't suppose you'd mind having a look for him?
3	option	Sure. Any idea where I should start looking?
4	line	Player	Sure. Any idea where I should start looking?
4	line	Charlie	Well the northern ferret is mostly found around the mountains just west of the Gnome Stronghold, so that would probably be as good a place as any to start looking.
4	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
4	action	end
3	option	Sorry, I don't have the time.
4	line	Player	Sorry, I don't have the time.
4	line	Charlie	Oh well, I'm sure he'll be okay out there on his own.
4	action	end
1	option	Where did you get the animals from?
2	line	Player	Where did you get the animals from?
2	line	Charlie	Oh, all over. Hunters bring us most of them; we pay well for anything unusual.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Charlie again
1	line	Charlie	Ah, hello again. Have you had any luck finding out about Nickolaus' whereabouts yet?
1	line	Player	No, nothing yet I'm afraid.
1	line	Charlie	Like I said, he's most likely to be camping out somewhere to the west of the Gnome Stronghold.
1	action	end
