1	box	This area of rock doesn't quite seem to match the rest of the cliff face. There appears to be a thin vertical slot in the middle of the rock, with what appears to be a carving of a feather above it.
1	action	end
0	section	Using the Metal feather on the Rocky outcrop
1	box	You place the metal feather into the groove in the cliff face. It seems to catch in some sort of mechanism.
1	box	Part of the cliff face swings outwards to reveal a tunnel heading into the mountain.
1	action	end
