0	section	With eagle outfit
1	line	Player	Hello Nickolaus, how are you getting on with your discoveries?
1	cond	If the player is wearing the eagle disguise:
2	line	Nickolaus	What's this, a young hatchling? Oh no, I hope it doesn't think I'm its dinner!
2	line	Player	No, Nickolaus, it's me! I'm just in disguise!
2	line	Nickolaus	You're sure...you're sure you're not going to eat me?
2	line	Player	No of course not. You sent me to get you an eagle outfit remember? So you could get out of this nest?
2	line	Nickolaus	Wow, that really is a very convincing disguise. Have you got one for me too?
1	action	continue
1	cond	If the player has a disguise for Nickolaus:
2	line	Player	Yes, I have one right here.
2	box	You give Nickolaus a fake beak and an eagle feather cape.
2	line	Nickolaus	Excellent, now there is no way the eagle will be able to tell me from one of its own.
2	line	Nickolaus	Now you run off, and I'll meet you back down at the camp site.
2	action	end
