0	section	Talking to Nickolaus again
1	line	Player	I've given you the disguise you needed, can we go now?
1	line	Nickolaus	Calm down. You must realise I can't leave just like that, this is far too amazing an opportunity. Just go down to the camp site and I'll meet you there.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Nickolaus by the camp
1	line	Player	Hello again Nickolaus.
1	line	Nickolaus	Ah, hello again. Can I help at all?
1	option	Well I was originally sent to find you because of a ferret.
2	line	Player	Well I was originally sent to find you because of a ferret. Can you get me one at all?
2	line	Nickolaus	I'll do better than that. I'll teach you how to capture one yourself.
2	option	That sounds good to me.
3	line	Player	That sounds good to me. What do I do.
3	line	Nickolaus	Come with me and I'll show you.
3	line	Player	Okay, so we've baited the trap with meat, now what?
3	line	Nickolaus	And now...we wait. Quietly!
3	line	Player	But what if I don't like waiting for things?
3	line	Nickolaus	Did I mention we wait quietly?
3	line	Nickolaus	Shhh, here comes something.
3	line	Nickolaus	Ha ha, there you go! One gift-wrapped ferret ready for delivery.
3	line	Nickolaus	See, it's all just a matter of patience.
3	line	Player	Great, thanks!
3	action	end
2	option	I've not got the time right now.
3	line	Player	I've not got the time right now.
3	line	Nickolaus	Ah you don't get out of it that easily. When you've got the time come back and see me.
3	action	end
1	option	I was just wondering how you got on with those eagles.
2	line	Player	I was just wondering how you got on with those eagles.
2	line	Nickolaus	Ah wonderfully. They're actually most cooperative creatures once they get used to you. With some rope I'm sure you could find some way to tame them... maybe even fly on them.
2	action	end
1	option	No thanks. I was just dropping by.
2	line	Player	No thanks. I was just dropping by, wanted to make sure you hadn't been abducted again.
2	line	Nickolaus	No such luck I'm afraid, but I'm sure I'll make another discovery soon enough. I always seem to.
2	action	end
